#~ "WordPress theme have been removed, and the default theme is now active. This"
#~ " process has cleared all customizations and settings related to other "
#~ "themes. You can now start fresh with theme setup or install a new theme to "
#~ "customize your site's appearance."
#~ msgstr ""
